      </div>
      <div class="ai-content">
        <h2>AI-Powered Everything</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 22px;">A defining theme of the 2025 lineup. AI is not just a feature—it's a platform-wide advantage connecting the entire ecosystem from your pocket to your living room.</p>
